[647.071089, "o", "We are fully open-source. Our [model weights](https://huggingface.co/open-thoughts), [datasets](https://huggingface.co/open-thoughts), [data generation code](https://github.com/open-thoughts/open-thoughts), [evaluation code](https://github.com/ml"]
[647.071244, "o", "foundations/Evalchemy), and [training code](https://github.com/hiyouga/LLaMA-Factory) are all publicly available. "]
[647.071395, "o", "\r\n"]
